# Every text file in the repo uses LF. Tools on Windows (and more than one
# automated edit) have written CRLF back, which turns a one-line change into
# a whole-file diff; normalising on commit stops that at the source.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
